183	 * outage doesn't silently ship stale placeholder copy to real shoppers. Note this puts a
184	 * fetch inside `components/`, which components.md reserves for containers; if that matters,
185	 * this should move into an `_app` override instead (Tier 2 shared shell — coordinate first).
