189	  // (`path === '/' ? '/' : updatedHref`), so navigate('/') pushes a bare '/' and skips the
190	  // site/locale prefix — on a prefixed storefront that drops the shopper onto the default
191	  // site. This is the exact pair base _app's onLogoClick uses, so both wordmarks resolve home
192	  // the same way on every storefront.
193	  //
194	  // useMultiSite ships untyped from the base SFCC package. site.id here is the correct
195	  // join key for this lookup specifically: resolveByRegion.ts compares it directly against
